    {
      "id": "n-note",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 40
      },
      "status": "idle",
      "data": {
        "type": "note",
        "text": "COMPLEX DELAY PIPELINE — no agents.\n\nFive subgraphs: Intake → Normalize → Fast∥Deep → Assemble.\nIn the app: right-click → ⊡ cleanup arrangement if frames look stacked.\n\n~20s wall clock with parallelism=2. Pass --approve-all for the final gate.",
